   The task required finding links to individual news articles published between May 14 and May 15, 2026, and returning a JSON array with full absolute URLs and publication dates. The agent successfully navigated to the correct page and identified two articles: one from May 14, 2026, and another from May 13, 2026. However, the agent incorrectly excluded the May 13 article despite it being within the specified date range (inclusive). More critically, the agent returned a relative URL ('/news/gates-foundation-partnership') instead of the full absolute URL ('https://www.anthropic.com/news/gates-foundation-partnership'), violating the output specification. The final JSON array also omits the second article entirely, making the output incomplete. While the agent used appropriate tools and navigation steps, the failure in URL formatting and filtering logic results in an incorrect final output. The screenshots confirm that the articles exist on the page, so the task was achievable but not completed correctly.

